cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use open-llm-router, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "open-llm-router"
abstract: >-
  Small open-source LLM router for locally hosted models. It exposes
  OpenAI- and Anthropic-compatible APIs, authenticates users with Keycloak
  (OIDC/SSO) and per-user API keys, routes requests by model to vLLM
  backends, and records per-user usage metadata without storing prompts.
type: software
authors:
